HyLaMAS is a derivative work: the LatentMAS method ported to hybrid
attention + Gated DeltaNet models (Qwen3.5). Files modified relative to the
upstream project carry a modification notice at the top of the file, per
Section 4(b) of the License. See DESIGN.md for the implementation notes and
README.md for a summary of what changed relative to upstream.

Portions of hybrid.py and models.py describe and interoperate with the
Qwen3.5 implementation in HuggingFace Transformers
(https://github.com/huggingface/transformers), also Apache-2.0 licensed. No
Transformers source is vendored here; the model's own kernels are called
directly.
